macfix includes a runtime Objective-C method stub adapted from
Cubes Without Borders by Kira NT:

  https://github.com/Kira-NT/cubes-without-borders
  commit b8a757842c8632ee39b83482583be4e2ae5665b0
  MIT License — Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Kira NT

That project discovered that macOS 26+ AppKit may call
-[NSWindowDelegate windowWillReturnFieldEditor:toObject:] while changing
NSWindow styleMask on undecorated GLFW windows, even though the method is
optional and GLFW's delegate does not implement it.
